-2.  Compute $S = F F^T$.
-3.  Extract upper triangle of $S$ for pairwise similarities.
-4.  Compute $\hat{s} = \sum_{i<j} w_{ij} S_{ij}$.
-5.  Compute $\hat{c} = \sum_{i=1}^K w_i \tilde{c}_i$ and $\hat{f} = \sum_{i=1}^K w_i f_i$.
